{
 "_doc": "Second pass of the Vaults hall (P-HALL, shell_chapel_hall): the weekly programme, the exhibition case and plaques by weekday, the guest book, the sound desk and the light panel by the hour, the backstage (costumes, props, make-up) and the week of the amateur play Time, Forward! from casting on Monday to the Saturday premiere the hero can watch; the dance night, the barre mirror, the chalk menu. Strings: strings/x_p_hall.json (city.xh.*). Quests for it are in /home/user/wt/quests_shell_chapel_hall.json. Round 2: texts (the play's script on the prompter's stand, a guest-book ledger growing by game day, a programme booklet, sheet music), the set hall_evenings (five ticket stubs shown on the foyer board by count), a dance-step rally and an audition duel with the choir leader, a draughts table, the exhibition changing by the week, bread, soup, tea and pies by the hour, staff talk (cloakroom, bar, choir leader, cook), clocks, light switches, closed lines of the night watchman, festival and weather lines; quest hall_audition.",
